{"id":"n1-181","title":"～がゆえの Noun (〜ga yue no Noun)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses the reason or cause for something; 'because of', 'due to'.","longExplanation":"The ～がゆえの Noun pattern is used to describe a noun that exists or occurs due to some cause. It is often used in more literary or formal contexts.","formation":"Noun / Verb-dictionary form + がゆえの + Noun","examples":[{"jp":"愛がゆえの悲しみ。","romaji":"Ai ga yue no kanashimi.","en":"Sadness due to love.","words":[{"surface":"愛","vocabId":"1150410","reading":"あい"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゆえ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"悲しみ","vocabId":"1590550","reading":"かなしみ"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"健康がゆえの幸せ。","romaji":"Kenkou ga yue no shiawase.","en":"Happiness due to good health.","words":[{"surface":"健康","vocabId":"1256170","reading":"けんこう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゆえ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"幸せ","vocabId":"1594060","reading":"しあわせ"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"悪行がゆえの罰。","romaji":"Akugyou ga yue no batsu.","en":"Punishment due to wrongdoing.","words":[{"surface":"悪行","vocabId":"1575740","reading":"あくぎょう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゆえ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"罰","vocabId":"1478060","reading":"ばつ"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"努力がゆえの成功。","romaji":"Doryoku ga yue no seikou.","en":"Success due to effort.","words":[{"surface":"努力","vocabId":"1445130","reading":"どりょく"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゆえ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]}]}